second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is the total population of Namakkal?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0212-e3269aca2a81:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 115, \"text\": \"Salem, Karur, Chennai Central, Bangalore, Dindigul, Palani, Madurai, Tirunelveli, Nagercoil, Pollachi and Palakkad.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0212-e3269aca2a81:d00\", \"start\": 116, \"end\": 226, \"text\": \"The nearest airports are Salem Airport (52 km), Coimbatore International Airport (153 km), and Trichy (85 km).\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0212-e3269aca2a81:d00\", \"start\": 227, \"end\": 271, \"text\": \"Salem Airport started from 15 November 2009.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0212-e3269aca2a81:d00\", \"start\": 272, \"end\": 430, \"text\": \"According to 2011 census, Namakkal had a population of 55,145 with a sex-ratio of 1,015 females for every 1,000 males, much above the national average of 929.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0212-e3269aca2a81:d00\", \"start\": 431, \"end\": 518, \"text\": \"A total of 5,002 were under the age of six, constituting 2,609 males and 2,393 females.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0212-e3269aca2a81:d00\", \"start\": 519, \"end\": 616, \"text\": \"Scheduled Castes and Scheduled Tribes accounted for 13.7% and .5% of the population respectively.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0212-e3269aca2a81:d00\", \"start\": 617, \"end\": 649, \"text\": \"The average literacy of the town\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0212-e3269aca2a81:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 200, \"text\": \"0.01 % Other 0.23 % No religion 0.01 % According to 2011 census , Namakkal had a population of 55,145 with a sex-ratio of 1,015 females for every 1,000 males , much above the national average of 929 .\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0212-e3269aca2a81:d01\", \"start\": 201, \"end\": 297, \"text\": \"[ 10 ] A total of 5,002 were under the age of six , constituting 2,609 males and 2,393 females .\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0212-e3269aca2a81:d01\", \"start\": 298, \"end\": 398, \"text\": \"Scheduled Castes and Scheduled Tribes accounted for 13.7 % and .5 % of the population respectively .\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0212-e3269aca2a81:d01\", \"start\": 399, \"end\": 491, \"text\": \"The average literacy of the town was 82.52 % , compared to the national average of 72.99 % .\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0212-e3269aca2a81:d01\", \"start\": 492, \"end\": 502, \"text\": \"[ 10 ] The\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0212-e3269aca2a81:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 128, \"text\": \"Namakkal 57,672 65,868 100,000 → Mallasamudram Town Panchayat Namakkal 13,062 17,181 18,007 → Mohanur Town Panchayat Namakkal...\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0212-e3269aca2a81:d02\", \"start\": 129, \"end\": 184, \"text\": \"12,468 14,315 → Nallipalayam Census Town Namakkal......\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0212-e3269aca2a81:d02\", \"start\": 185, \"end\": 234, \"text\": \"5,078 → Namagiripettai Town Panchayat Namakkal...\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0212-e3269aca2a81:d02\", \"start\": 235, \"end\": 342, \"text\": \"21,446 21,250 → Namakkal Municipality Namakkal 45,038 53,055 55,145 → Padaiveedu Town Panchayat Namakkal...\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0212-e3269aca2a81:d02\", \"start\": 343, \"end\": 460, \"text\": \"10,066 10,451 → Pallipa